# quant.term requires no environment variables for the main dashboard.
#
# Active browser data sources are public and read-only:
# - Binance Spot REST/WebSocket
# - Binance USDⓈ-M REST/WebSocket
# - CryptoCompare news
# - mempool.space Bitcoin network data
# - Alternative.me Fear & Greed
#
# Copying this file to .env is optional.
#
# Security note: every VITE_* value is embedded in the client bundle and is
# visible to visitors. Never place exchange credentials or private API keys in
# a VITE_* variable. Add authenticated providers through a secured backend or
# serverless proxy instead.
